#' \strong{SLiMBuiltin method:} Documentation for SLiM function \code{codonsToAminoAcids}, which is a method of the SLiM class \code{\link{SLiMBuiltin}}.
#' Note that the R function is a stub, it does not do anything in R (except bring up this documentation). It will only do
